      "text": "LOVELOCK (1919–2022):\n  Gaia: Earth regulates itself as a single system\n  → Atmosphere, oceans, life, rocks form a coupled system\n  → Homeostasis at planetary scale\n  → Not teleological: no plan; just selection of\n    self-regulating configurations\n  → Influenced by: actual atmospheric chemistry measurement\n  → Influenced: Earth system science; climate policy"
